ely and is not a model feature, so no model can restate the label.","n = 88 labelled objects cannot support a claim about asbestos content. These models are decision support for choosing what to sample next, not a safety clearance.","The image/text probes rest on the 18 labelled objects that have a frozen T-029 vector: a demonstration of the pipeline, not evidence."],"power_statement":"n = 88 labelled objects (42 positive, 46 negative) over 16 function classes. A text model has hundreds of candidate terms, so events per variable are far below 1; the cross-validated numbers below cannot support a claim about which objects contain asbestos. They can order the next samples for a curator.","selection_bias":"The museum sampled the objects it judged suspect, so the positive share among sampled objects is an upper bound on nothing: it is a sampling artefact, not prevalence."}